# phd_raw_data release clone.
#
# This directory is ALSO the research platform's working data directory: the live
# database, its backups, journals, checkpoints, caches, model files and the raw
# collection tree sit here untracked. None of them is part of the public release,
# which is only: .gitignore, .gitattributes, README.md, raw.zip and enriched_data/.
#
# A second guard lives in .git/info/exclude of this clone: deny everything, then
# allow the release files by name. It is kept there rather than here because the
# parent research repository also reads this file, and an allow-list here would
# make the release files visible to that repository.

# Databases, journals, backups and checkpoints, at any depth.
*.db
*.db-*
*.db.*
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite-*
*.backup
*.bak
*.bak.*
*-wal
*-shm
*checkpoint*

# Platform artifacts that are not part of the release.
/raw/
/synthetic/
/chroma_data/
/images/
/llm_cache/
/models/
/test_samples/
/.gitkeep
/memgraph_demo_queries.json
/memgraph_pagerank.json
/synchronised_spikes.csv
/translation_spot_check.json
